#: scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3d292100b7da72bc629cf2180278e059a1f9b98aaf160221086af1b8e552b09
#. default-sha256: d4b6492b145dda387498298fbed5c48f0a88d8bde0867bbfc51504be91504a69
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EEB345D2_374F_4A69_8A38_45C397C88D8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am, even now, putting her through a harrowing experience.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Digging up the memories "
"she locked away,⟪k:3⟫the past she wanted to pretend never happened,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anche adesso, la sto sottoponendo a un’esperienza straziante.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Riportando alla luce "
"i ricordi che aveva sotterrato—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫il passato che ha fatto finta non fosse mai accaduto"
"—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1245256a1c21d339eede8083ba0242e540042adee03ea8a0c3171daa509596cf
#. default-sha256: aa859fd7f153bc0e630ce0dabc2642a1c372cec06d1bd1e06d7e9f7e3faaf02c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A9E263E_6BB2_438F_B623_7DD9173964F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ get her back to who she once was... ⟪k:3⟫even if means forcing her to "
"endure this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, io ⟪k:1⟫devo⟪k:2⟫ fare in modo che torni a essere quella di un tempo...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"anche se questo significa costringerla a soffrire di nuovo."

