"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Perfect darkness embraces us once more.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can see nothing—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"not even the woman beside me—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La totale oscurità ci abbraccia nuovamente.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non riesco a vedere nulla"
"—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫nemmeno la donna a fianco a me—"

