msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There weren’t hundreds, but ⟪k:1⟫thousands⟪k:2⟫ of people bustling about. Merchants from "
"afar came in droves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non c’erano centinaia, ma ⟪k:1⟫migliaia⟪k:2⟫ di persone che frequentavano questo posto. "
"Mercanti da ogni dove giungevano a frotte."

#: scenario5:scenario5_71F229FB_7362_4221_9345_9FEAF100B178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
