msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People, crops, livestock, all dead.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maybe it was a natural disaster, a famine, a "
"plague—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I can’t say for sure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Abitanti, coltivazioni, bestiame, tutti morti.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Forse è stato un disastro naturale, "
"una carestia, un’epidemia—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫non so dirlo con certezza."

