msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The city was so large that the mansion was actually in its borders.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My guess is the "
"bridge was built to mark the road leading to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La città era così grande che la villa si trovava praticamente al confine.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La mia "
"ipotesi è che il ponte sia stato costruito per indicare la strada che conduce lì."

#: scenario5:scenario5_051B9A84_0600_41B1_95E8_D61DE028237E
